  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2301.17 “Registration decal” means a 3 inch square sticker placed on a vessel which indicates that the vessel has been registered.\n\nSource. #8617, eff 4-28-06, EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
